<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - Oct 17.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - Oct 17.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain trades at 1415 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Milling wheat 11 pct protein to Liverpool Oct 125.00 Jan/Mar 126.00</p>
<p>Southampton, Tewkesbury, Avonmouth and Gloucester Oct 122.00</p>
<p>Feed wheat to Southampton Nov 102.50</p>
<p>Norfolk/Suffolk Nov 102.00</p>
<p>Hereford Nov 100.00</p>
<p>Avon Jan/Mar 104.50</p>
<p>Devon Jan/Mar 105.00/04.50 Apr/Jun 108.00/07.50</p>
<p>Hampshire Nov 102.00</p>
<p>Liverpool Jan/Mar 106.00/105.50</p>
<p>Tilbury Nov 102.00/02.50</p>
<p>No barley trade was reported.</p>
</text>
